  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A steel rod has a radius of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi></math> and a length of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>.</mo></math> A force of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>62</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kN</mi></math> stretches it along its length. Young&#39;s modulus of steel is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The longitudinal strain produced in the wire is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "25",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Young&#39;s modulus is given as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>Stress</mi><mi>Strain</mi></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>F</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><mi>L</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac></math></p><p>The given data is&nbsp;</p><p>Stress<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>62</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kN</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Thus,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Strain</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#215;</mo><mi>Y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8710;</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><mi>L</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>62</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
